 suggest how to enforce the locking? \r\nHow is the caller expected to handle the error if `resetTransportAndUnlock` doesn't panic?\r\nSince its a private method, doesn't a panic make the failure more visible and ensure incorrect usages are caught by tests?","created_at":"2024-07-09T06:43:56Z","updated_at":"2024-07-09T06:43:56Z","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7390#discussion_r1669833842","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/7390","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/comments/1669833842"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/7390#discussion_r1669833842"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/7390"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/comments/1669833842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":1234,"original_line":1231,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":1669193136,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":30,"position":33,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/comments/1669868782","pull_request_review_id":2165259028,"id":1669868782,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAacf885jiCzu","diff_hunk":"@@ -1231,8 +1228,7 @@ func (ac *addrConn) adjustParams(r transport.GoAwayReason) {\n \t}\n }\n \n-func (ac *addrConn) resetTransport() {\n-\tac.mu.Lock()\n+func (ac *addrConn) resetTransportAndUnlock() {","path":"clientconn.go","commit_id":"76ef33f44a600c3ed1a385979fd1dfbcade3fbb6","original_commit_id":"6214c9dd1cd421727852b03cafceac7c9e9eb973","user":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42